ed store system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing Sim:</strong> Upgrade your rod, hooks, and bait to catch higher rank fish \u2014 sell them or gut them for special loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Early-Game Minigame:</strong> A new small-scale activity designed to give players an engaging option early on in their adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f <strong>Lottery System:</strong> Gamble your coins by purchasing lottery tickets of varying prices \u2014 high risk, high reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>In-Game Library:</strong> Learn about items, enemies, and systems in the comprehensive in-game wiki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Day/Night Cycle:</strong> Time passes based on your actions, not a real-time clock \u2014 giving you full control over how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 120+ weapon and armor designs, infinite dungeon layouts, and a gear recycling/forging system, <i>Dungeon Stars</i> ensures that no two runs are ever the same. Build your team, conquer the ranks, and become a legend in the stars!</p>",
